---
title: SmartSchools Events and External Integrations
config:
  theme: neutral
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph DOMAIN[Domain transaction]
    command[Authorized command]
    mutation[Update domain records]
    outbox[(Write outbox row in same transaction)]
    command --> mutation --> outbox
  end

  dispatcher[Outbox dispatcher] --> queue[SQS queue by event family]
  outbox --> dispatcher
  queue --> worker[Idempotent consumer]
  worker --> effects[Domain side effect or notification]
  worker --> processed[(Processed event ID and result)]
  queue --> dlq[Dead-letter queue and controlled replay]

  subgraph EVENTS[Example business events]
    enrolled[StudentEnrolled]
    curriculum[CurriculumVersionApproved]
    marked[AssessmentMarked]
    attendance[AttendanceRecorded]
    payment[PaymentVerified]
    handover[StudentHandoverConfirmed]
  end
  outbox --> EVENTS

  subgraph ADAPTERS[Replaceable integration adapters]
    pay[Paystack test adapter]
    message[Email, SMS and push]
    gps[GPS and transport device simulator]
    gate[QR/RFID and gate device simulator]
    ai[AI provider adapter]
  end
  worker <--> pay
  worker <--> message
  worker <--> gps
  worker <--> gate
  worker <--> ai

  webhook[Signed provider webhook] --> verify[Verify signature on raw bytes<br/>and record provider event ID]
  verify --> queue
  verify -. invalid signature .-> reject[Reject and audit]

  envelope[Event envelope<br/>ID · type · schema version · time<br/>tenant/campus · actor · correlation · payload]
  outbox -. publishes .-> envelope
  privacy[No unnecessary child data in event metadata<br/>Consumers fetch only authorized fields]
  privacy -. governs .-> envelope
